<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo Lwakalembwa aJuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo Lwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDA</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lugwalo lwaJuda</char> ndugwalo luunikidwe mulembi walo. Juda uliyubununa kali mwanike waJakkobbu, Jakkobbu mwanike waJesu. Aboobo kusyomwa kuti nguumwi mwanike waJesu (Juda 1). Takukwe nzituzi pe kuti oolu lugwalo lwakalembeledwe mbungano yakuli alimwi nkaambo kakutondeka kuChizuminano Chakale, basikubala bataanzi baJuda bakali baJuda. Nikuba oobo, ulemba lugwalo lwakwe “Kuli boonse bakayitwa, bayandwa muli Leza Taata alimwi babambilidwe Jesu Kkirisitu” (Juda 1). Lugwalo oolu lwakalembwa mumunyaka wamakumi alimusanu akkumi limwi Jesu kaali wazyalwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nchaakalulembela lugwalo oolu kubanaKkirisitu boonse nkaambo kakuti abachenjezye atala akuleyesegwa anjisyo zitaluleme (Juda 4). Ubelesya zitondezyo zyaChizuminano Chakale akupa bukamboni akusimya kukazya kwakwe. Lugwalo oolu luleendelana kayingi <char style="bk">aPita wachibili</char> mukubikilizya aamwi mukupa kuchenjezya atala anjisyo yakubeja ( Juda 4; 2 Pita 2:1) alubo kitondeka kubaangelo alimwi Sodomu aGomora.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Juda utalika akwaambula atala abasikubala (Juda 1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela, upa kaambo kakuti nkaamboonzi nalikulemba kuti abachenjezye atala abayiisyi babeji (Juda 3-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Namana aawo upa mukozyano wabantu azyakachitika muChizuminano Chakale (Juda 5-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mpawo ulabaambila mbubeelede kuvwiila kuli zeezyo nzyakabachenjezya (Juda 17-23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kumamanino usimpa lugwalo lwakwe akutembawula Leza (Juda 24-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Ndime Juda, mulanda waJesu Kkirisitu alimwi mwanike waJakkobbu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Kuli baabo bakayitwa, bayandwa muli Leza Taata abakabambwa obotu nkaambo kaJesu Kkirisitu:<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Luse aluumuno aluyando luvule mulindinywe.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bayiisyi Babeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Nimuyandwa, kandili achiyandisyo chipati chakumulembela atala alufutuko lwesu ndutwabilana, ndajana kazyeelede kuti ndimulembele kandili kumusungwazya kukwabilila lusyomo oolo kamwi kwalyoonse lwakapegwa kubasalali. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Nkaambo bamwi bantu bakanjila mukavwindi akati kanu, aabo kubetekwa kwabo kwakalembwa kale chiindi chakale. Aaba mbantu batayoowi Leza basandula luzyalo lwaLeza wesu mukupona mubwaamu akukaka Simalelo wesu aliikke aMwami, Jesu Kkirisitu.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Lino ndiyanda kumuyeezya, nikuba mwakali mwaambilwa buzwide, kuti Jesu ooyo wakafutula bantu kuzwa munyika yaIjiputi, mukweenda kuzwa aawo wakabanyonyoona aabo batakwe bakali kusyoma pe. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Alimwi baangelo aabo batakwe bakabamba zyuuno zyabo pesi bakasiya busena bwabo bwakukkala bakabambwa mumudima mubwaangwe butamani kukuyoosika kubuzuba bupati bwalubeta, <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />mbuli bantu baSodomu aGomora azisi zizyungulukide, aabo bakapona munjalalando akuba mukulombozya kutaambiki, bakaba chitondeezyo mukunjila muchisubulo chamulilo utamani.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Anukuti mbuli mbuboobo aaba bantu mumaloto aabo babisizya mubili, balakaka bweendelezi, akusampawula baluleme bakujulu. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Pesi mungelo mupati Mayikkeli, naakalwana aSikuchenga, bakakazyaniya atala amutunta waMozesi, takukwe naakamubeteka alutuko pe, pesi wakati, “Mwami akupe mulandu.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Pesi bantu aaba balatukila atala azintu kufumbwa nzibatamvwisisisyi pe, azintu eezyo nzibazi kabatakwe kuyeeya mbuli banyama bamusokwe zilengwa zitakwe manu mbubachita, zintu eezi nziibanyonyoona. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Maawe kulimbabo! Nkaambo beenda munzila yaKkeyini, alimwi balalitakata nkaambo kakujana mukubisya kwaBbalamu, alimwi bakapapa mbuli Kkora mbwaakapapa, alimwi bakanyonyoonwa mbuli nguwe. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Aaba bantu bali mbuli tyombe muli chakulya mumapobwe aanu aluyando, mbuli mbubalya andinywe kabatakwe bweeme, kabaliilanga lwabo beni, bali mbuli mayoba atakwe mvula, aayo awungwa aguwo, bali mbuli misamu itakwe michelo muchindi chamayinza, yakafwidilila, inonkwedwe, <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />bali mbuli mayuwe amulwizi alaanguzu, aawaala ikkovu lyamawuse aawo; bali mbuli inyenyezi zyabuyo zyeempeta eezyo zibambilidwe mudima utamani kwalyoonse.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Wakali Inokki wakasinsima muzyalani lyamusanu aabili kuzwa kuli Adamu, wati, “Amulange, Mwami uyobola abasalali bakwe balizyuulu, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />kuzobeteka boonse, akukuyoopa chisubulo kuli boonse batazi Leza nkaambo kanchito zyabo zitali zyabunaLeza nzibakakachita munzila itali yabuna Leza, alimwi azyoonse zitalueme eezyo batazi Leza nzibakaambuula atala anguwe.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Aaba mbaasikunyontooka, basikutamikizya, zisusi zyabo zibi, balisumpula amilomo yabo, basikuchenga, bayuunga bantu mutwambo kuti bajane.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Machenjezyo aMalayilile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Nimuyandwa, pesi mweelede kuyeeya, zyakasinsimwa abatumwa baMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />bakati kulindinywe,“Mumazuba amamanino kuyooba basikuweela, batobela nzibayanda zitakwe bunaLeza.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Aaba mbiibantu beeta kwanzaaniya, mbantu banyika, batakwe Muuya. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Pesi inywe, nimuyandwa, amuliyake mulusyomo lwanu lusalala, amukombe muMuuya Usalala, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />amulibambe muluyando lwaLeza, akulindila luse lwaMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu kuti amweete kubuumi butamani.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Amube aluse, kulibaabo badoneeka, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />amubavune bamwi, akubakwempa kuzwa mumulilo, kuli bamwi amube aluse lulakuyoowa Leza, akusula nikuba chisamo chabo chisofwazigwa azisusi zyazibi.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkombyo yaKulumbayizya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Lino kuli ooyo ukonzya kumubamba kukuzwa kukuwa akumweeta kamutakwe kampenda kunembo lyabulemu bwakwe alukondo, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />kuli Leza aliikke, Mufutuli wesu mukwiinda muli Jesu Kkirisitu Mwami wesu, akube bulemu, abupati, abweendelezi anguzu, kuchiindi choonse chakayinda alino akwalyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>